 could have the opportunity and  the freedom to define my own success  i'm not closing the door this is my  manager's office  in 2016 he landed a role in the  groundbreaking canadian sitcom kim's  convenience  [Music]  not long after leo was up for the role  of a lifetime as shanghi i called my  parents and i and i was like guys i'm  freaking out i don't know what to do  and um  and my mom said  whether you get this job or not  doesn't change how much we love you  it's just a matter of time for you you  know we believe in you and  that was everything i needed to hear you  know i felt like  alone you know as this kind of lone wolf  person against the world you know i had  been doing pretty good for myself but  i just felt like with the support of of  my family behind me and my community i  mean i could i could do anything and  he's proven he can he says his  relationship with his parents is now  stronger than ever and hopes his success  helps create more representation for  asians in hollywood i'm going to be  unapologetic about who i am and where i  come from and i'm going to be a  representative you've hosted snl  time 100 most influential people the  world is your oyster what is next for  you i want to tell the stories that  really matter so that you know kids the  asian kids watching today can can turn  on the tv and feel that we never did  which is  this was made for me  [Music]  this was made for me nice yeah very nice  piece  you like the style there yeah yeah the  no shirt with the buckle man quite a  journey yeah i like this story though i  mean it just shows you everybody has a  story you would not know that he had  that background and that kind of  has  came from such a tumultuous place yeah  to be doing what he's doing and going  out for that that big role the one that  we all know him for his parents just  saying no matter what and then calling  your parents proud i like that we got  you we got your back regardless we're  proud of the understanding of hi